# good: lamp and motor share one loop, so each gets less push (dim).
kits scb20, sc100
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at A1 dir=right level=1
step 3: L4 at A5 dir=down level=1
step 4: M7 at C5 dir=left level=1
step 5: S1 at C2 dir=left level=1
step 6: wire3 at A3 dir=right level=2
step 7: wire2 at B5 dir=down level=2
step 8: wire3 at C4 dir=left level=2
step 9: wire3 at C1 dir=up level=2
expect S1=on: L4 on dim
expect S1=on: M7 on dim
expect S1=off: L4 off
